https://github.com/apitrace/apitrace (cmake and build first)


Capture
=======
./../../../apitrace/build/apitrace trace --api gl ./glxgears

Dump Calls (Not State)
========== 
./../../../apitrace/build/apitrace dump glxgears.trace

Replay (Possibly using a different GL Renderer)
======
./../../../apitrace/build/apitrace replay glxgears.trace

Trim by frameset
================
./../../../apitrace/build/apitrace trim  --frames 200-212  glxgears.trace -o triage.trace 


Dump State
==========
./../../../apitrace/build/apitrace replay -D 19 ./glxgears.trace  ;;  Dump state at call#19
                                                                  ;;  call numbers provided in 
                                                                  ;;  replay
